      "en": "Abraham became the father of Isaac. Isaac became the father of Jacob. Jacob became the father of Judah and his brothers.",
      "ko": "아브라함이 이삭을 낳고 이삭은 야곱을 낳고 야곱은 유다와 그의 형제를 낳고",
      "source_text_hash": "86173ce48b3f60df7ede1461574031519a510e1a3a9439230a9429e1092f0a53",
      "translation_text_hash": "59ca43974e2f1708650140362b87be33af1925f96d2e2252d68f8c4b0c8b94f2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
