      "en": "Ram became the father of Amminadab. Amminadab became the father of Nahshon. Nahshon became the father of Salmon.",
      "ko": "람은 아미나답을 낳고 아미나답은 나손을 낳고 나손은 살몬을 낳고",
      "source_text_hash": "be0cc0b1a05abfbf83311970e67df8b996ca6b22ef1bf960cc33f7b9a3ff1e4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f44f69bdcd514eac4e0d5196869c0ba290803a5b9fd75d60f9fec2c0ad69274",
