      "en": "Salmon became the father of Boaz by Rahab. Boaz became the father of Obed by Ruth. Obed became the father of Jesse.",
      "ko": "살몬은 라합에게서 보아스를 낳고 보아스는 룻에게서 오벳을 낳고 오벳은 이새를 낳고",
      "source_text_hash": "7bf8540eda7de7f9ac6592d243120c509514d20d9acf0567da4dfb2399d6bd12",
      "translation_text_hash": "eadd0e0a1d8b1d7ceed352759b4770fc41e2eebb111fc99ebcb3f81ee5819a1b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "살몬은 라합에게서 보아스를 낳고 보아스는 룻에게서 오벳을 낳고 오벳은 이새를 낳고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "eadd0e0a1d8b1d7ceed352759b4770fc41e2eebb111fc99ebcb3f81ee5819a1b"
      ]
