      "en": "Joseph, her husband, being a righteous man, and not willing to make her a public example, intended to put her away secretly.",
      "ko": "그 남편 요셉은 의로운 사람이라 저를 드러내지 아니하고 가만히 끊고자하여",
      "source_text_hash": "4d75ecd6b62b0b429a49609a71034935623346b611d77b1a64a933eaa48d8a78",
