        "verse": 20
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MAT",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "But when he thought about these things, behold, an angel of the Lord appeared to him in a dream, saying, “Joseph, son of David, don’t be afraid to take to yourself Mary as your wife, for that which is conceived in her is of the Holy Spirit.",
      "ko": "이 일을 생각할 때에 주의 사자가 현몽하여 가로되 다윗의 자손 요셉아 네 아내 마리아 데려오기를 무서워 말라 저에게 잉태된 자는 성령으로 된 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "10602f78176598ff839e98dfaa1722442df6462396b17321f5644fe3b28b71c4",
      "translation_text_hash": "b89f86fee5ec898f6de26ccf0d42ba2cd3bb4054d6551c3b573a52ce454cfa9c",
