      "en": "She shall give birth to a son. You shall name him Jesus, for it is he who shall save his people from their sins.”",
      "ko": "아들을 낳으리니 이름을 예수라 하라 이는 그가 자기 백성을 저희 죄에서 구원할 자이심이라 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "190a22a0bbc51896ae8c6908f813b928cd26e121603d17f88bb65650ba48a259",
      "translation_text_hash": "c3f931318c1f2b20cd16a10ddffa0b1429573f7086a86ad88b0dce3e763a16c7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
