      "en": "Joseph arose from his sleep, and did as the angel of the Lord commanded him, and took his wife to himself;",
      "ko": "요셉이 잠을 깨어 일어나서 주의 사자의 분부대로 행하여 그 아내를 데려 왔으나",
      "source_text_hash": "a8db94a4aa8d63a5d5357823e5eda10448a723f5b7f3964f41b2e904219bb033",
